Yes you did. We were talking about the record file, not the logfile.
Record is kept in descending score order, so the files have to be
merged, not just one appended after another.
And there are the limits of maximum three scores for any given name/role
pair and maximum 100 total entries that the utility keeps track of.

Not very difficult, but it was a suitable hobby project to practice on
when I learned C 19 years ago.
Now that I look at it, I'm not very proud of it, but it works :-)

